                Select Distinct
                    c.FreightAdviceNo
                from 
                    lr a,
                    FreightAdviceDetail b,
                    FreightAdvice c
                Where   a.Tno=b.MODULETNO(+)
                        and b.Tno=c.Tno(+);
                ```
